  planner_response {
    response: "The Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan website has been built as a high-performance, premium React application using Tailwind CSS and Motion. \n\n### Key Features Implemented:\n- **Premium Branding:** Utilizes the official Rotary Royal Blue (`#003F87`) and Rotaract Gold (`#F7A81B`) with a modern, high-contrast typographic hierarchy using the **Inter** font family.\n- **Dynamic Interactions:** \n    - **IntersectionObserver** triggered fade-in animations for all sections.\n    - **Animated Stat Counters** that transition upwards when scrolled into view.\n    - **Sticky Navigation** with scroll-triggered shadow and a responsive mobile drawer.\n- **Intentional Design:** \n    - **Hero Section:** Features a CSS-generated geometric pattern and abstract SVG compositions, avoiding low-quality stock photography.\n    - **Board of Directors:** Professional cards for the 2025\342\200\2232026 leadership team, featuring Rtr. Olabisi Adeniyi (President) and Rtr. King Praise (Vice President).\n    - **Impact-Oriented Projects:** Detailed grid covering Health, Education, Environment, and Vocational Support.\n- **Functional Components:** \n    - **Next Events:** Horizontal cards with date badges and call-to-action buttons.\n    - **Donation Section:** Three-tiered giving options with localized Naira values (\342\202\2465,000, \342\202\24620,000, \342\202\24650,000) and descriptions of their social impact.\n- **Technical Excellence:** Fully mobile-first design, smooth anchor-link navigation, and optimized for fast performance.\n\nThe application follows the modern React/Vite architecture requested, ensuring it runs perfectly in the preview environment with zero additional setup."
    modified_response: "The Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan website has been built as a high-performance, premium React application using Tailwind CSS and Motion. \n\n### Key Features Implemented:\n- **Premium Branding:** Utilizes the official Rotary Royal Blue (`#003F87`) and Rotaract Gold (`#F7A81B`) with a modern, high-contrast typographic hierarchy using the **Inter** font family.\n- **Dynamic Interactions:** \n    - **IntersectionObserver** triggered fade-in animations for all sections.\n    - **Animated Stat Counters** that transition upwards when scrolled into view.\n    - **Sticky Navigation** with scroll-triggered shadow and a responsive mobile drawer.\n- **Intentional Design:** \n    - **Hero Section:** Features a CSS-generated geometric pattern and abstract SVG compositions, avoiding low-quality stock photography.\n    - **Board of Directors:** Professional cards for the 2025\342\200\2232026 leadership team, featuring Rtr. Olabisi Adeniyi (President) and Rtr. King Praise (Vice President).\n    - **Impact-Oriented Projects:** Detailed grid covering Health, Education, Environment, and Vocational Support.\n- **Functional Components:** \n    - **Next Events:** Horizontal cards with date badges and call-to-action buttons.\n    - **Donation Section:** Three-tiered giving options with localized Naira values (\342\202\2465,000, \342\202\24620,000, \342\202\24650,000) and descriptions of their social impact.\n- **Technical Excellence:** Fully mobile-first design, smooth anchor-link navigation, and optimized for fast performance.\n\nThe application follows the modern React/Vite architecture requested, ensuring it runs perfectly in the preview environment with zero additional setup."
