  planner_response {
    response: "The Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan website has been updated with the **Professional Polish** design theme. \n\n### Key Design Enhancements:\n- **Refined Layout Structure:** Adjusted spacing and alignment to mirror the crisp, structured layout of the target design, including a side-by-side \"Upcoming Events\" section and a streamlined \"Board of Directors\" grid.\n- **Enhanced Typography & Color:** Implemented high-contrast tracking and specific font-weight pairings (Inter ExtraBold for headings, Bold uppercase for labels) using the brand\'s Royal Blue and Rotaract Gold.\n- **Polished Card Aesthetics:** Applied the specific `border-l-4` patterns on project cards and value statements, complemented by `shadow-sm` and `rounded-xl/2xl` for a more modern, professional feel.\n- **Dynamic Geometric Details:** Integrated the radial-gradient dot pattern into the Hero and Donate sections and added a custom-shaded SVG composition in the Hero area to replace stock imagery.\n- **Interactive Refinements:** \n    - Updated the **Navbar** with a clean border-bottom and refined padding on scroll.\n    - Added vertical stat dividers (pipes) in the **Impact Section** for better readability.\n    - Refined the **Date Badges** in the events section using a soft `bg-blue-50` backdrop.\n    - Applied a `subpixel-antialiased` font rendering for maximum text clarity.\n\nThe application remains fully functional, responsive, and maintainable, now with a world-class visual presence."
    modified_response: "The Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan website has been updated with the **Professional Polish** design theme. \n\n### Key Design Enhancements:\n- **Refined Layout Structure:** Adjusted spacing and alignment to mirror the crisp, structured layout of the target design, including a side-by-side \"Upcoming Events\" section and a streamlined \"Board of Directors\" grid.\n- **Enhanced Typography & Color:** Implemented high-contrast tracking and specific font-weight pairings (Inter ExtraBold for headings, Bold uppercase for labels) using the brand\'s Royal Blue and Rotaract Gold.\n- **Polished Card Aesthetics:** Applied the specific `border-l-4` patterns on project cards and value statements, complemented by `shadow-sm` and `rounded-xl/2xl` for a more modern, professional feel.\n- **Dynamic Geometric Details:** Integrated the radial-gradient dot pattern into the Hero and Donate sections and added a custom-shaded SVG composition in the Hero area to replace stock imagery.\n- **Interactive Refinements:** \n    - Updated the **Navbar** with a clean border-bottom and refined padding on scroll.\n    - Added vertical stat dividers (pipes) in the **Impact Section** for better readability.\n    - Refined the **Date Badges** in the events section using a soft `bg-blue-50` backdrop.\n    - Applied a `subpixel-antialiased` font rendering for maximum text clarity.\n\nThe application remains fully functional, responsive, and maintainable, now with a world-class visual presence."
