  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Rotary Connection**\n\nI\'m focusing on expanding the \'About Us\' section, specifically the Rotary International connection. I\'m thinking about how to concisely articulate our relationship with Rotary. Also, I\'m exploring the best placement for the Rotary logo to enhance visibility. I am currently considering visual examples for impact.\n\n\n**Expanding Website Features**\n\nI\'ve been working on integrating new features. I\'m focusing on adding detailed project descriptions and board member cards with images. The animated scroll progress bar is nearly complete. I\'m also planning to create a modal for event details and add social media links and a Rotary logo. I\'ll be updating `App.tsx` and defining a `Modal` component, and updating data. I\'ve found a Rotary logo URL!\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "v9gqyg1n"
      name: "edit_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Instruction\":\"Expand the About section with Rotary details and logo, add detailed projects, board images, and an event modal in App.tsx.\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"import { useState, useEffect, useRef } from \'react\';\\nimport { motion, useScroll, useSpring, AnimatePresence } from \'motion/react\';\\nimport { \\n  Users, \\n  CheckCircle2, \\n  Heart, \\n  Calendar, \\n  ExternalLink, \\n  Menu, \\n  X, \\n  ChevronRight, \\n  MapPin, \\n  Mail, \\n  Phone, \\n  Instagram, \\n  Linkedin, \\n  Twitter, \\n  MessageSquare,\\n  Award,\\n  Zap,\\n  Globe,\\n  Briefcase,\\n  BookOpen,\\n  Leaf,\\n  Stethoscope,\\n  Info,\\n  Clock,\\n  User\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\n// --- Types ---\\n\\ninterface Event {\\n  month: string;\\n  day: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  lead: string;\\n  time: string;\\n  location: string;\\n  description: string;\\n}\\n\\n// --- Components ---\\n\\nconst Modal = ({ isOpen, onClose, event }: { isOpen: boolean, onClose: () => void, event: Event | null }) => {\\n  if (!isOpen || !event) return null;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <AnimatePresence>\\n      <div className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-[100] flex items-center justify-center p-4\\\">\\n        <motion.div \\n          initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\\n          animate={{ opacity: 1 }}\\n          exit={{ opacity: 0 }}\\n          onClick={onClose}\\n          className=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-dark/80 backdrop-blur-sm\\\"\\n        />\\n        <motion.div \\n          initial={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.95, y: 20 }}\\n          animate={{ opacity: 1, scale: 1, y: 0 }}\\n          exit={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.95, y: 20 }}\\n          className=\\\"relative bg-white w-full max-w-lg rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl z-10\\\"\\n        >\\n          <div className=\\\"bg-rotary-blue p-8 text-white relative\\\">\\n            <button onClick={onClose} className=\\\"absolute top-6 right-6 text-white/50 hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">\\n              <X size={24} />\\n            </button>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-4\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"bg-rotaract-gold text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-black text-xl\\\">\\n                {event.day} {event.month}\\n              </div>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-white/60 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs\\\">Upcoming Event</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-3xl font-black leading-tight italic\\\">{event.title}</h3>\\n          </div>\\n          \\n          <div className=\\\"p-8 space-y-6\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-6\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-rotaract-gold uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                  <Clock size={12} /> Time\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-brand-dark\\\">{event.time}</div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-rotaract-gold uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                  <MapPin size={12} /> Venue\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-brand-dark\\\">{event.location}</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-rotaract-gold uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                <Info size={12} /> About this event\\n              </div>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                {event.description}\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"pt-6 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-50 flex items-center justify-center text-rotary-blue\\\">\\n                  <User size={20} />\\n                </div>\\n                <div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-brand-muted uppercase tracking-widest leading-none mb-1\\\">Coordinated By</div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-xs font-black text-brand-dark\\\">{event.lead}</div>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <button className=\\\"bg-rotary-blue text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full font-bold text-sm shadow-md hover:bg-opacity-90 transition-all\\\">\\n                RSVP Now\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </motion.div>\\n      </div>\\n    </AnimatePresence>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst Navbar = () => {\\n  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const [scrolled, setScrolled] = useState(false);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const handleScroll = () => setScrolled(window.scrollY > 20);\\n    window.addEventListener(\'scroll\', handleScroll);\\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(\'scroll\', handleScroll);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const navLinks = [\\n    { name: \'Home\', href: \'#home\' },\\n    { name: \'About\', href: \'#about\' },\\n    { name: \'Board\', href: \'#board\' },\\n    { name: \'Projects\', href: \'#projects\' },\\n    { name: \'Events\', href: \'#events\' },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <nav className={`fixed w-full z-50 transition-all duration-300 ${scrolled ? \'bg-white shadow-sm py-4 h-20 flex items-center border-b border-gray-100\' : \'bg-transparent py-6 h-24 flex items-center\'}`}>\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-10 w-full flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"#home\\\" className={`text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight ${scrolled ? \'text-rotary-blue\' : \'text-white\'}`}>\\n          Rotaract <span className=\\\"text-rotaract-gold\\\">Ring Road</span>\\n        </a>\\n\\n        {/* Desktop Links */}\\n        <div className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 font-medium text-sm\\\">\\n          {navLinks.map((link) => (\\n            <a \\n              key={link.name} \\n              href={link.href} \\n              className={`transition-colors hover:text-rotaract-gold ${scrolled ? \'text-brand-muted hover:text-rotary-blue\' : \'text-white/80 hover:text-white\'}`}\\n            >\\n              {link.name}\\n            </a>\\n          ))}\\n          <a href=\\\"#donate\\\" className=\\\"bg-rotaract-gold text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full font-bold shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition-all\\\">\\n            Donate\\n          </a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Mobile Toggle */}\\n        <button className=\\\"md:hidden\\\" onClick={() => setIsOpen(!isOpen)}>\\n          {isOpen ? <X size={24} className={scrolled ? \'text-brand-dark\' : \'text-white\'} /> : <Menu size={24} className={scrolled ? \'text-brand-dark\' : \'text-white\'} />}\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Mobile Drawer */}\\n      <AnimatePresence>\\n        {isOpen && (\\n          <motion.div \\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: -20 }}\\n            animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n            exit={{ opacity: 0, y: -20 }}\\n            className=\\\"absolute top-full left-0 w-full bg-white shadow-2xl py-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-8 md:hidden border-t border-gray-50\\\"\\n          >\\n            {navLinks.map((link) => (\\n              <a \\n                key={link.name} \\n                href={link.href} \\n                onClick={() => setIsOpen(false)}\\n                className=\\\"text-brand-dark font-bold text-lg\\\"\\n              >\\n                {link.name}\\n              </a>\\n            ))}\\n            <a href=\\\"#donate\\\" onClick={() => setIsOpen(false)} className=\\\"bg-rotaract-gold text-white px-10 py-3 rounded-full font-bold text-lg shadow-lg\\\">\\n              Donate\\n            </a>\\n          </motion.div>\\n        )}\\n      </AnimatePresence>\\n    </nav>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst Hero = () => {\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"home\\\" className=\\\"relative min-h-[700px] md:h-[80vh] bg-rotary-blue flex items-center overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10\\\" style={{ backgroundImage: \'radial-gradient(#fff 1px, transparent 1px)\', backgroundSize: \'20px 20px\' }}></div>\\n      \\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-12 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center z-10 py-20\\\">\\n        <motion.div \\n          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}\\n          whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n          transition={{ duration: 0.8 }}\\n          viewport={{ once: true }}\\n          className=\\\"max-w-md\\\"\\n        >\\n          <span className=\\\"inline-block bg-rotaract-gold text-rotary-blue text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded mb-6 uppercase\\\">\\n            Service Above Self \302\267 Ibadan, Nigeria\\n          </span>\\n          <h1 className=\\\"text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-[1.1] mb-6 tracking-tight text-white italic\\\">\\n            Young Leaders. <br/>Real Service. <br/>Lasting Impact.\\n          </h1>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-blue-100 text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed font-light\\\">\\n            Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan empowers young professionals to take action in their communities and lead meaningful change.\\n          </p>\\n          <div className=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n            <a href=\\\"#about\\\" className=\\\"bg-white text-rotary-blue px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold flex items-center shadow-lg hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\\\">\\n              Learn More <span className=\\\"ml-2\\\">\342\206\222</span>\\n            </a>\\n            <a href=\\\"#projects\\\" className=\\\"border-2 border-white/30 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-white/10 transition-all\\\">\\n              Our Projects\\n            </a>\\n          </div>\\n        </motion.div>\\n\\n        <motion.div \\n          initial={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.8 }}\\n          whileInView={{ opacity: 1, scale: 1 }}\\n          transition={{ duration: 1 }}\\n          viewport={{ once: true }}\\n          className=\\\"relative flex justify-center\\\"\\n        >\\n          <div className=\\\"relative w-64 h-64 md:w-80 md:h-80\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-rotaract-gold rounded-full opacity-20 animate-pulse\\\"></div>\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 100 100\\\" className=\\\"w-full h-full text-white fill-current opacity-80 overflow-visible\\\">\\n              <circle cx=\\\"50\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"45\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"0.2\\\" className=\\\"opacity-30\\\" />\\n              <path d=\\\"M50 10 L50 90 M10 50 L90 50 M20 20 L80 80 M80 20 L20 80\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"0.5\\\" className=\\\"opacity-50\\\" />\\n              <motion.circle \\n                cx=\\\"50\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"30\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#F7A81B\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"1\\\" strokeDasharray=\\\"10 5\\\"\\n                animate={{ rotate: 360 }}\\n                transition={{ duration: 20, repeat: Infinity, ease: \\\"linear\\\" }}\\n              />\\n            </svg>\\n            <div className=\\\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex items-center justify-center p-8 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-full border border-white/10 shadow-2xl\\\">\\n              <Users size={64} className=\\\"text-rotaract-gold opacity-90\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </motion.div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"absolute bottom-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 animate-bounce opacity-40\\\">\\n        <ChevronRight size={32} className=\\\"rotate-90 text-white\\\" />\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst Impact = () => {\\n  const stats = [\\n    { value: 50, label: \'Members\', suffix: \'+\' },\\n    { value: 12, label: \'Projects\', suffix: \'+\' },\\n    { value: 1000, label: \'Lives Impacted\', suffix: \'+\' },\\n    { value: 5, label: \'Years\', suffix: \'+\' },\\n  ];\\n\\n  const Counter = ({ value, suffix }: { value: number, suffix: string }) => {\\n    const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\\n    const nodeRef = useRef(null);\\n\\n    useEffect(() => {\\n      const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\\n        if (entries[0].isIntersecting) {\\n          let start = 0;\\n          const end = value;\\n          const duration = 1500;\\n          const increment = end / (duration / 16);\\n          \\n          const timer = setInterval(() => {\\n            start += increment;\\n            if (start >= end) {\\n              setCount(end);\\n              clearInterval(timer);\\n            } else {\\n              setCount(Math.floor(start));\\n            }\\n          }, 16);\\n        }\\n      }, { threshold: 0.5 });\\n\\n      if (nodeRef.current) observer.observe(nodeRef.current);\\n      return () => observer.disconnect();\\n    }, [value]);\\n\\n    return <span ref={nodeRef}>{count}{suffix}</span>;\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"impact\\\" className=\\\"bg-rotaract-gold h-auto py-10 md:h-24 md:py-0 flex items-center justify-around px-12 border-b border-white/10\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-wrap md:flex-nowrap items-center justify-around gap-8\\\">\\n        {stats.map((stat, i) => (\\n          <div key={i} className=\\\"flex items-center gap-8 md:gap-12 lg:gap-16\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"text-3xl font-black text-rotary-blue tracking-tighter\\\">\\n                <Counter value={stat.value} suffix={stat.suffix} />\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-rotary-blue/70 tracking-widest mt-0.5\\\">{stat.label}</div>\\n            </div>\\n            {i < stats.length - 1 && (\\n              <div className=\\\"hidden md:block h-8 w-px bg-rotary-blue/20\\\"></div>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n        ))}\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst About = () => {\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"about\\\" className=\\\"py-24 bg-white overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-12\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center\\\">\\n          <motion.div \\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, x: -20 }}\\n            whileInView={{ opacity: 1, x: 0 }}\\n            transition={{ duration: 0.6 }}\\n            viewport={{ once: true }}\\n          >\\n            <h2 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-rotaract-gold mb-4\\\">The Foundation</h2>\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-dark mb-8 leading-[1.2] tracking-tight\\\">\\n              Rooted in Service, <br />\\n              <span className=\\\"text-rotary-blue italic\\\">Part of the Global Rotary Family.</span>\\n            </h3>\\n            <div className=\\\"space-y-6 text-brand-muted leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-base\\\">\\n              <p>\\n                Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan is a service organization sponsored by the Rotary Club of Ring Road, Ibadan. As part of Rotary International, we are members of a global network of 1.4 million neighbors, friends, and leaders who see a world where people unite and take action to create lasting change.\\n              </p>\\n              <p>\\n                Our partnership with Rotary International gives us the mentorship, resources, and global reach to tackle the most pressing humanitarian challenges, starting right here in Ibadan. We share the Rotary vision of building a better world through service, fellowship, and integrity.\\n              </p>\\n              <div className=\\\"pt-6 flex items-center gap-8 opacity-80 filter grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\\\">\\n                <img \\n                  src=\\\"https://logos-world.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/Rotary-Logo.png\\\" \\n                  alt=\\\"Rotary International Logo\\\" \\n                  className=\\\"h-16 object-contain\\\"\\n                  referrerPolicy=\\\"no-referrer\\\"\\n                />\\n                <div className=\\\"h-12 w-px bg-gray-200\\\"></div>\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] leading-tight\\\">\\n                  Official Sponsor of <br /> Ring Road Rotaract\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </motion.div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center p-12 bg-brand-bg rounded-[40px] border border-gray-50 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden group\\\">\\n               <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-rotary-blue/5 scale-0 group-hover:scale-100 transition-transform duration-700 rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n               <div className=\\\"italic font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl text-rotary-blue mb-4 relative z-10\\\">\\\"Service Above Self\\\"</div>\\n               <div className=\\\"text-rotaract-gold font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] relative z-10\\\">The Universal Rotary Motto</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border-l-4 border-rotaract-gold shadow-sm flex items-start gap-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"w-12 h-12 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\\\">\\n                <Globe size={20} className=\\\"text-rotary-blue\\\" />\\n              </div>\\n              <div>\\n                <div className=\\\"font-bold text-rotary-blue text-lg\\\">Global Connectivity</div>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-xs lg:text-sm text-brand-muted mt-2 font-medium\\\">As Rotaractors, we are part of District 9125, connecting with thousands of fellow changemakers across Nigeria and the world.</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst Board = () => {\\n  const members = [\\n    { name: \'Rtr. Olabisi Adeniyi\', role: \'President\', isLead: true, bio: \'A visionary leader committed to uplifting Ibadan through sustainable service.\' },\\n    { name: \'Rtr. King Praise\', role: \'VP & Secretary\', isLead: false, bio: \'Administrative powerhouse ensuring smooth operations and strategic growth.\' },\\n    { name: \'Rtr. Abiola Hassan\', role: \'Welfare Director\', isLead: false, bio: \'Dedicated to the holistic well-being and growth of every club member.\' },\\n    { name: \'Rtr. Sarah Johnson\', role: \'Public Relations\', isLead: false, bio: \'Voice of the club, bridging our impact with the local community.\' },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"board\\\" className=\\\"py-24 bg-brand-bg border-t border-gray-100\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-12\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"text-center mb-16\\\">\\n          <h2 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-rotaract-gold mb-3\\\">Leadership</h2>\\n          <h3 className=\\\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-rotary-blue tracking-tight italic\\\">The 2025\342\200\2232026 Board of Directors</h3>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\\\">\\n          {members.map((m, i) => (\\n            <motion.div \\n              key={i}\\n              initial={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.95 }}\\n              whileInView={{ opacity: 1, scale: 1 }}\\n              transition={{ delay: i * 0.1 }}\\n              viewport={{ once: true }}\\n              className=\\\"bg-white rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all group flex flex-col items-center p-8 text-center border-t-8 border-transparent hover:border-rotaract-gold\\\"\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"relative mb-6\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-rotary-blue/10 rounded-full scale-110 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform duration-500\\\"></div>\\n                <img \\n                  src={`https://picsum.photos/seed/${m.name}/300/300`} \\n                  alt={m.name} \\n                  className=\\\"w-32 h-32 rounded-full object-cover border-4 border-white shadow-lg relative z-10\\\"\\n                  referrerPolicy=\\\"no-referrer\\\"\\n                />\\n              </div>\\n              <h4 className=\\\"text-xl font-black text-brand-dark mb-1\\\">{m.name}</h4>\\n              <p className={`text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 ${m.isLead ? \'text-rotaract-gold\' : \'text-rotary-blue\'}`}>\\n                {m.role}\\n              </p>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed italic\\\">\\n                \\\"{m.bio}\\\"\\n              </p>\\n            </motion.div>\\n          ))}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst Projects = () => {\\n  const projects = [\\n    { \\n      title: \'Health & Wellness\', \\n      icon: Stethoscope, \\n      color: \'border-rotaract-gold\',\\n      detailed: \'We provide annual health screenings, drug donations, and sanitation awareness in Ibadan settlements like Odo-Ona and Oluyole.\' \\n    },\\n    { \\n      title: \'Education Outreach\', \\n      icon: BookOpen, \\n      color: \'border-rotary-blue\',\\n      detailed: \'Our \\\"Project Read\\\" initiative provides stationary, textbooks, and reading glasses to over 500 primary school students annually.\' \\n    },\\n    { \\n      title: \'Environmental Action\', \\n      icon: Leaf, \\n      color: \'border-rotaract-gold\',\\n      detailed: \'Monthly city-wide cleaning campaigns and our \\\"Green Ibadan\\\" tree-planting project to combat local climate issues.\' \\n    },\\n    { \\n      title: \'Vocational Support\', \\n      icon: Zap, \\n      color: \'border-rotary-blue\',\\n      detailed: \'We organize quarterly skills-acquisition workshops for local artisans, teaching financial literacy and digital marketing.\' \\n    },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"projects\\\" className=\\\"py-24 bg-white\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-12\\\">\\n        <h2 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-rotaract-gold mb-10\\\">Impact in Action</h2>\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12\\\">\\n          {projects.map((p, i) => (\\n            <motion.div \\n              key={i}\\n              initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}\\n              whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n              transition={{ delay: i * 0.1 }}\\n              viewport={{ once: true }}\\n              className={`bg-brand-bg p-10 rounded-[40px] border-l-8 ${p.color} shadow-sm group hover:shadow-md transition-all flex items-start gap-8`}\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"w-16 h-16 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\\\">\\n                <p.icon className=\\\"text-rotary-blue\\\" size={32} />\\n              </div>\\n              <div>\\n                <div className=\\\"font-black text-rotary-blue text-2xl group-hover:text-rotaract-gold transition-colors mb-2 italic\\\">\\n                  {p.title}\\n                </div>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-sm lg:text-base text-brand-muted leading-relaxed font-medium\\\">\\n                  {p.detailed}\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n            </motion.div>\\n          ))}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst Events = () => {\\n  const [selectedEvent, setSelectedEvent] = useState<Event | null>(null);\\n  \\n  const events: Event[] = [\\n    { \\n      month: \'MAY\', \\n      day: \'10\', \\n      title: \'Club Strategic Meeting\', \\n      lead: \'Rtr. King Praise\',\\n      time: \'4:00 PM - 6:00 PM\',\\n      location: \'Jogor Centre, Ibadan\',\\n      description: \'Our monthly general assembly to discuss administrative updates, fiscal reports, and finalize planning for our upcoming \\\"Educate a Girl\\\" project.\'\\n    },\\n    { \\n      month: \'MAY\', \\n      day: \'24\', \\n      title: \'Joint District Fellowship\', \\n      lead: \'Rtr. Risqat\',\\n      time: \'6:30 PM - 9:00 PM\',\\n      location: \'Premier Hotel, Ibadan\',\\n      description: \'A networking and cultural exchange evening with Rotaractors from District 9125. Expect keynote speakers on leadership and local social impact.\'\\n    },\\n    { \\n      month: \'JUN\', \\n      day: \'13\', \\n      title: \'Service Outreach: Omi Adio\', \\n      lead: \'Rtr. Toffy\',\\n      time: \'9:00 AM - 3:00 PM\',\\n      location: \'Omi Adio Primary School\',\\n      description: \'Hands-on community project involving the renovation of classroom facilities and a vocational workshop for adult residents of the Omi Adio settlement.\'\\n    },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"events\\\" className=\\\"py-24 bg-brand-bg\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-12\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-10\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"w-1/3\\\">\\n            <h2 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-rotaract-gold mb-4\\\">The Calendar</h2>\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-rotary-blue mb-6 tracking-tight italic\\\">Join the Fellowship</h3>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed font-medium\\\">We meet regularly and serve passionately. Click an event to learn more about how you can participate.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"w-2/3 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\\\">\\n            {events.map((e, i) => (\\n              <motion.div \\n                key={i}\\n                initial={{ opacity: 0, x: 20 }}\\n                whileInView={{ opacity: 1, x: 0 }}\\n                transition={{ delay: i * 0.1 }}\\n                viewport={{ once: true }}\\n                onClick={() => setSelectedEvent(e)}\\n                className=\\\"flex items-center gap-6 p-4 rounded-[28px] bg-white border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all group cursor-pointer\\\"\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 bg-blue-50 rounded-2xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-rotary-blue group-hover:bg-rotary-blue group-hover:text-white transition-all transform group-hover:scale-105\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-tighter\\\">{e.month}</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-2xl font-black leading-none\\\">{e.day}</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-base font-black text-brand-dark group-hover:text-rotaract-gold transition-colors italic\\\">{e.title}</div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-[10px] text-brand-muted font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-1\\\">Lead: {e.lead}</div>\\n                </div>\\n              </motion.div>\\n            ))}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <Modal isOpen={!!selectedEvent} onClose={() => setSelectedEvent(null)} event={selectedEvent} />\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst Donate = () => {\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"donate\\\" className=\\\"py-16 bg-white\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-12\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-brand-dark rounded-[48px] p-16 text-white text-center shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:row items-center justify-between gap-12\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-rotaract-gold/30 -mr-32 -mt-32 rounded-full blur-[80px]\\\"></div>\\n          <div className=\\\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-64 h-64 bg-rotary-blue/30 -ml-32 -mb-32 rounded-full blur-[80px]\\\"></div>\\n          \\n          <div className=\\\"text-left md:w-3/5 relative z-10\\\">\\n            <h2 className=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-rotaract-gold mb-4\\\">Invest in our Future</h2>\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-6 tracking-tighter leading-tight\\\">Every Seed We Plant <br /><span className=\\\"text-rotaract-gold italic\\\">Changes a Life in Ibadan.</span></h3>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-base text-gray-400 leading-relaxed font-light\\\">Join our mission to provide clean water, quality education, and medical access. 100% of your donations go directly to project execution.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          \\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 w-full md:w-auto relative z-10\\\">\\n            <button className=\\\"bg-rotaract-gold text-white px-12 py-5 rounded-full font-black text-lg shadow-xl hover:bg-[#e09818] transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1\\\">\\n              Donate Now\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst Footer = () => {\\n  return (\\n    <footer className=\\\"bg-white py-16 border-t border-gray-100\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-12\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col md:row justify-between items-center gap-12 mb-16\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"text-center md:text-left\\\">\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-3xl font-black text-rotary-blue tracking-tighter mb-2\\\">Rotaract Ring Road</h3>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-[0.4em]\\\">Service Above Self \302\267 Ibadan</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"flex gap-6\\\">\\n            <a href=\\\"https://instagram.com\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" className=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-bg flex items-center justify-center text-brand-dark hover:bg-rotaract-gold hover:text-white transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-sm\\\">\\n              <Instagram size={20} />\\n            </a>\\n            <a href=\\\"https://linkedin.com\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" className=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-bg flex items-center justify-center text-brand-dark hover:bg-rotaract-gold hover:text-white transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-sm\\\">\\n              <Linkedin size={20} />\\n            </a>\\n            <a href=\\\"https://twitter.com\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" className=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-bg flex items-center justify-center text-brand-dark hover:bg-rotaract-gold hover:text-white transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-sm\\\">\\n              <Twitter size={20} />\\n            </a>\\n            <a href=\\\"https://wa.me/2348100000000\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" className=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-bg flex items-center justify-center text-brand-dark hover:bg-rotaract-gold hover:text-white transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-sm\\\">\\n              <MessageSquare size={20} />\\n            </a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col md:row justify-between items-center gap-6 text-[10px] text-gray-300 font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] border-t border-gray-50 pt-12\\\">\\n          <div>\302\251 2026 Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan. District 9125</div>\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-rotary-blue\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-rotaract-gold rounded-full shadow-[0_0_8px_#F7A81B]\\\"></span>\\n            Affiliated with Rotary International\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nexport default function App() {\\n  const { scrollYProgress } = useScroll();\\n  const scaleX = useSpring(scrollYProgress, {\\n    stiffness: 100,\\n    damping: 30,\\n    restDelta: 0.001\\n  });\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"font-sans text-brand-dark bg-white subpixel-antialiased\\\">\\n      <motion.div \\n        className=\\\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 h-1.5 bg-rotaract-gold z-[100] origin-left shadow-[0_0_15px_#F7A81B]\\\"\\n        style={{ scaleX }}\\n      />\\n      \\n      <Navbar />\\n      \\n      <main>\\n        <Hero />\\n        <Impact />\\n        <About />\\n        <Board />\\n        <Projects />\\n        <Events />\\n        <Donate />\\n      </main>\\n\\n      <Footer />\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"TargetContent\":\"import { useState, useEffect, useRef } from \'react\';\\nimport { motion, useScroll, useSpring, AnimatePresence } from \'motion/react\';\\nimport { \\n  Users, \\n  CheckCircle2, \\n  Heart, \\n  Calendar, \\n  ExternalLink, \\n  Menu, \\n  X, \\n  ChevronRight, \\n  MapPin, \\n  Mail, \\n  Phone, \\n  Instagram, \\n  Linkedin, \\n  Twitter, \\n  MessageSquare,\\n  Award,\\n  Zap,\\n  Globe,\\n  Briefcase,\\n  BookOpen,\\n  Leaf,\\n  Stethoscope\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\n// --- Components ---\\n\\nconst Navbar = () => {\\n  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const [scrolled, setScrolled] = useState(false);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const handleScroll = () => setScrolled(window.scrollY > 20);\\n    window.addEventListener(\'scroll\', handleScroll);\\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(\'scroll\', handleScroll);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const navLinks = [\\n    { name: \'Home\', href: \'#home\' },\\n    { name: \'About\', href: \'#about\' },\\n    { name: \'Board\', href: \'#board\' },\\n    { name: \'Projects\', href: \'#projects\' },\\n    { name: \'Events\', href: \'#events\' },\\n    { name: \'Partner\', href: \'#partner\' },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <nav className={`fixed w-full z-50 transition-all duration-300 ${scrolled ? \'bg-white shadow-sm py-4 h-20 flex items-center border-b border-gray-100\' : \'bg-transparent py-6 h-24 flex items-center\'}`}>\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-10 w-full flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"#home\\\" className={`text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight ${scrolled ? \'text-rotary-blue\' : \'text-white\'}`}>\\n          Rotaract <span className=\\\"text-rotaract-gold\\\">Ring Road</span>\\n        </a>\\n\\n        {/* Desktop Links */}\\n        <div className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 font-medium text-sm\\\">\\n          {navLinks.map((link) => (\\n            <a \\n              key={link.name} \\n              href={link.href} \\n              className={`transition-colors hover:text-rotaract-gold ${scrolled ? \'text-brand-muted hover:text-rotary-blue\' : \'text-white/80 hover:text-white\'}`}\\n            >\\n              {link.name}\\n            </a>\\n          ))}\\n          <a href=\\\"#donate\\\" className=\\\"bg-rotaract-gold text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full font-bold shadow-md hover:bg-[#e09818] transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-0.5\\\">\\n            Donate\\n          </a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Mobile Toggle */}\\n        <button className=\\\"md:hidden\\\" onClick={() => setIsOpen(!isOpen)}>\\n          {isOpen ? <X size={24} className={scrolled ? \'text-brand-dark\' : \'text-white\'} /> : <Menu size={24} className={scrolled ? \'text-brand-dark\' : \'text-white\'} />}\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Mobile Drawer */}\\n      <AnimatePresence>\\n        {isOpen && (\\n          <motion.div \\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: -20 }}\\n            animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n            exit={{ opacity: 0, y: -20 }}\\n            className=\\\"absolute top-full left-0 w-full bg-white shadow-2xl py-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-8 md:hidden border-t border-gray-50\\\"\\n          >\\n            {navLinks.map((link) => (\\n              <a \\n                key={link.name} \\n                href={link.href} \\n                onClick={() => setIsOpen(false)}\\n                className=\\\"text-brand-dark font-bold text-lg\\\"\\n              >\\n                {link.name}\\n              </a>\\n            ))}\\n            <a href=\\\"#donate\\\" onClick={() => setIsOpen(false)} className=\\\"bg-rotaract-gold text-white px-10 py-3 rounded-full font-bold text-lg shadow-lg\\\">\\n              Donate\\n            </a>\\n          </motion.div>\\n        )}\\n      </AnimatePresence>\\n    </nav>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst Hero = () => {\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"home\\\" className=\\\"relative min-h-[700px] md:h-[80vh] bg-rotary-blue flex items-center overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10\\\" style={{ backgroundImage: \'radial-gradient(#fff 1px, transparent 1px)\', backgroundSize: \'20px 20px\' }}></div>\\n      \\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-12 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center z-10 py-20\\\">\\n        <motion.div \\n          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}\\n          whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n          transition={{ duration: 0.8 }}\\n          viewport={{ once: true }}\\n          className=\\\"max-w-md\\\"\\n        >\\n          <span className=\\\"inline-block bg-rotaract-gold text-rotary-blue text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded mb-6 uppercase\\\">\\n            Service Above Self \302\267 Ibadan, Nigeria\\n          </span>\\n          <h1 className=\\\"text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-[1.1] mb-6 tracking-tight text-white\\\">\\n            Young Leaders. <br/>Real Service. <br/>Lasting Impact.\\n          </h1>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-blue-100 text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed font-light\\\">\\n            Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan empowers young professionals to take action in their communities and lead meaningful change.\\n          </p>\\n          <div className=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n            <a href=\\\"#partner\\\" className=\\\"bg-white text-rotary-blue px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold flex items-center shadow-lg hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\\\">\\n              Get Involved <span className=\\\"ml-2\\\">\342\206\222</span>\\n            </a>\\n            <a href=\\\"#projects\\\" className=\\\"border-2 border-white/30 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-white/10 transition-all\\\">\\n              Our Projects\\n            </a>\\n          </div>\\n        </motion.div>\\n\\n        <motion.div \\n          initial={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.8 }}\\n          whileInView={{ opacity: 1, scale: 1 }}\\n          transition={{ duration: 1 }}\\n          viewport={{ once: true }}\\n          className=\\\"relative flex justify-center\\\"\\n        >\\n          <div className=\\\"relative w-64 h-64 md:w-80 md:h-80\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-rotaract-gold rounded-full opacity-20 animate-pulse\\\"></div>\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 100 100\\\" className=\\\"w-full h-full text-white fill-current opacity-80 overflow-visible\\\">\\n              <circle cx=\\\"50\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"45\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"0.2\\\" className=\\\"opacity-30\\\" />\\n              <path d=\\\"M50 10 L50 90 M10 50 L90 50 M20 20 L80 80 M80 20 L20 80\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"0.5\\\" className=\\\"opacity-50\\\" />\\n              <motion.circle \\n                cx=\\\"50\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"30\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#F7A81B\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"1\\\" strokeDasharray=\\\"10 5\\\"\\n                animate={{ rotate: 360 }}\\n                transition={{ duration: 20, repeat: Infinity, ease: \\\"linear\\\" }}\\n              />\\n            </svg>\\n            <div className=\\\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex items-center justify-center p-8 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-full border border-white/10 shadow-2xl\\\">\\n              <Users size={64} className=\\\"text-rotaract-gold opacity-90\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </motion.div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"absolute bottom-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 animate-bounce opacity-40\\\">\\n        <ChevronRight size={32} className=\\\"rotate-90 text-white\\\" />\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst Impact = () => {\\n  const stats = [\\n    { value: 50, label: \'Members\', suffix: \'+\' },\\n    { value: 12, label: \'Projects\', suffix: \'+\' },\\n    { value: 1000, label: \'Lives Impacted\', suffix: \'+\' },\\n    { value: 5, label: \'Years\', suffix: \'+\' },\\n  ];\\n\\n  const Counter = ({ value, suffix }: { value: number, suffix: string }) => {\\n    const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\\n    const nodeRef = useRef(null);\\n\\n    useEffect(() => {\\n      const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\\n        if (entries[0].isIntersecting) {\\n          let start = 0;\\n          const end = value;\\n          const duration = 1500;\\n          const increment = end / (duration / 16);\\n          \\n          const timer = setInterval(() => {\\n            start += increment;\\n            if (start >= end) {\\n              setCount(end);\\n              clearInterval(timer);\\n            } else {\\n              setCount(Math.floor(start));\\n            }\\n          }, 16);\\n        }\\n      }, { threshold: 0.5 });\\n\\n      if (nodeRef.current) observer.observe(nodeRef.current);\\n      return () => observer.disconnect();\\n    }, [value]);\\n\\n    return <span ref={nodeRef}>{count}{suffix}</span>;\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"impact\\\" className=\\\"bg-rotaract-gold h-auto py-10 md:h-24 md:py-0 flex items-center justify-around px-12 border-b border-white/10\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-wrap md:flex-nowrap items-center justify-around gap-8\\\">\\n        {stats.map((stat, i) => (\\n          <div key={i} className=\\\"flex items-center gap-8 md:gap-12 lg:gap-16\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"text-3xl font-black text-rotary-blue tracking-tighter\\\">\\n                <Counter value={stat.value} suffix={stat.suffix} />\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-rotary-blue/70 tracking-widest mt-0.5\\\">{stat.label}</div>\\n            </div>\\n            {i < stats.length - 1 && (\\n              <div className=\\\"hidden md:block h-8 w-px bg-rotary-blue/20\\\"></div>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n        ))}\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst About = () => {\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"about\\\" className=\\\"py-24 bg-white overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-12\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center\\\">\\n          <motion.div \\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, x: -20 }}\\n            whileInView={{ opacity: 1, x: 0 }}\\n            transition={{ duration: 0.6 }}\\n            viewport={{ once: true }}\\n          >\\n            <h2 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-rotaract-gold mb-4\\\">The Foundation</h2>\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-dark mb-8 leading-[1.2] tracking-tight\\\">\\n              Rooted in Service, <br />\\n              <span className=\\\"text-rotary-blue\\\">Driven by Action.</span>\\n            </h3>\\n            <div className=\\\"space-y-6 text-brand-muted leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-base\\\">\\n              <p>\\n                The Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan is part of a global effort to bring peace and international understanding to the world. We provide an opportunity for young people to enhance their knowledge and skills for personal development.\\n              </p>\\n              <p>\\n                Our mission is simple: to address the physical and social needs of our community while promoting better relations between all people worldwide through a framework of friendship and service.\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n          </motion.div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center p-12 bg-brand-bg rounded-3xl border border-gray-50 shadow-sm\\\">\\n               <div className=\\\"italic font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-rotary-blue mb-4\\\">\\\"Service Above Self\\\"</div>\\n               <div className=\\\"text-rotaract-gold font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest\\\">The Rotary Motto</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-rotaract-gold shadow-sm flex items-start gap-6\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"w-12 h-12 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\\\">\\n                <Heart size={20} className=\\\"text-rotary-blue\\\" />\\n              </div>\\n              <div>\\n                <div className=\\\"font-bold text-rotary-blue text-lg\\\">Community Impact</div>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-xs lg:text-sm text-brand-muted mt-2 font-medium\\\">Focusing on high-impact projects that solve real problems in Ibadan settlements.</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst Board = () => {\\n  const members = [\\n    { initials: \'OA\', name: \'Rtr. Olabisi Adeniyi\', role: \'President\', isLead: true },\\n    { initials: \'KP\', name: \'Rtr. King Praise\', role: \'VP & Secretary\', isLead: false },\\n    { initials: \'AH\', name: \'Rtr. Abiola Hassan\', role: \'Welfare Director\', isLead: false },\\n    { initials: \'SJ\', name: \'Rtr. Sarah Johnson\', role: \'Public Relations\', isLead: false },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"board\\\" className=\\\"py-24 bg-white border-t border-gray-100\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-12\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex justify-between items-end mb-12\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <h2 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-rotaract-gold mb-3\\\">The Board</h2>\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-rotary-blue tracking-tight\\\">Our Leadership <span className=\\\"text-gray-400 font-medium ml-2 text-sm italic\\\">2025\342\200\2232026</span></h3>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\\\">\\n          {members.map((m, i) => (\\n            <motion.div \\n              key={i}\\n              initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 10 }}\\n              whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n              transition={{ delay: i * 0.1 }}\\n              viewport={{ once: true }}\\n              className={`flex items-center gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border-2 transition-all group cursor-default ${m.isLead ? \'border-rotaract-gold shadow-md\' : \'border-gray-100 hover:border-rotary-blue/20 shadow-sm\'}`}\\n            >\\n              <div className={`w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shrink-0 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110 ${m.isLead ? \'bg-rotary-blue text-white\' : \'bg-gray-100 text-rotary-blue\'}`}>\\n                {m.initials}\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-brand-dark truncate\\\">{m.name}</div>\\n                <div className={`text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide ${m.isLead ? \'text-rotaract-gold\' : \'text-brand-muted\'}`}>{m.role}</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </motion.div>\\n          ))}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst Projects = () => {\\n  const projects = [\\n    { title: \'Health & Wellness\', icon: Stethoscope, color: \'border-rotaract-gold\' },\\n    { title: \'Education Outreach\', icon: BookOpen, color: \'border-rotary-blue\' },\\n    { title: \'Environmental Action\', icon: Leaf, color: \'border-rotaract-gold\' },\\n    { title: \'Youth Empowerment\', icon: Zap, color: \'border-rotary-blue\' },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"projects\\\" className=\\\"py-24 bg-brand-bg\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-12\\\">\\n        <h2 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-rotaract-gold mb-10\\\">Impact in Action</h2>\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\\\">\\n          {projects.map((p, i) => (\\n            <motion.div \\n              key={i}\\n              initial={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.95 }}\\n              whileInView={{ opacity: 1, scale: 1 }}\\n              transition={{ delay: i * 0.05 }}\\n              viewport={{ once: true }}\\n              className={`bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 ${p.color} shadow-sm group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow`}\\n            >\\n              <p.icon className=\\\"text-rotary-blue mb-4 opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\\\" size={24} />\\n              <div className=\\\"font-bold text-rotary-blue text-base group-hover:text-rotaract-gold transition-colors\\\">{p.title}</div>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-brand-muted mt-2 leading-relaxed font-medium\\\">Delivering critical support to schools and health centers across Ibadan.</p>\\n            </motion.div>\\n          ))}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst Events = () => {\\n  const events = [\\n    { month: \'MAY\', day: \'10\', title: \'Club Meeting\', lead: \'Rtr. King Praise\' },\\n    { month: \'MAY\', day: \'24\', title: \'Joint Fellowship\', lead: \'Rtr. Risqat\' },\\n    { month: \'JUN\', day: \'13\', title: \'Rotary Meeting\', lead: \'Rtr. Toffy\' },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"events\\\" className=\\\"py-24 bg-white\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-12\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-10\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"w-1/3\\\">\\n            <h2 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-rotaract-gold mb-4\\\">The Calendar</h2>\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-rotary-blue mb-6 tracking-tight\\\">Upcoming Events</h3>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed font-medium\\\">Join us at our weekly gatherings and monthly service outings in the Ring Road area.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"w-2/3 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\\\">\\n            {events.map((e, i) => (\\n              <motion.div \\n                key={i}\\n                initial={{ opacity: 0, x: 20 }}\\n                whileInView={{ opacity: 1, x: 0 }}\\n                transition={{ delay: i * 0.1 }}\\n                viewport={{ once: true }}\\n                className=\\\"flex items-center gap-6 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md transition-all group\\\"\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-rotary-blue group-hover:bg-rotary-blue group-hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-tighter\\\">{e.month}</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-xl font-black leading-none\\\">{e.day}</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-brand-dark group-hover:text-rotary-blue transition-colors\\\">{e.title}</div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-[10px] text-brand-muted font-bold uppercase tracking-wide mt-0.5\\\">Lead: {e.lead}</div>\\n                </div>\\n              </motion.div>\\n            ))}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst Donate = () => {\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"donate\\\" className=\\\"py-16 bg-white border-t border-gray-50\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-12\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-brand-dark rounded-3xl p-12 text-white text-center shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:row items-center justify-between gap-10\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-rotaract-gold -mr-16 -mt-16 rounded-full opacity-20 blur-xl\\\"></div>\\n          <div className=\\\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-32 h-32 bg-rotary-blue -ml-16 -mb-16 rounded-full opacity-20 blur-xl\\\"></div>\\n          \\n          <div className=\\\"text-left md:w-1/2\\\">\\n            <h2 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-rotaract-gold mb-3\\\">Support the Mission</h2>\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-3xl font-extrabold mb-4 tracking-tight\\\">Fuel Our Projects</h3>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed font-light\\\">Every naira contributed directly supports community healthcare, literacy programs, and vocational training across Ibadan settlements.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          \\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 w-full md:w-auto\\\">\\n            <button className=\\\"bg-rotaract-gold text-white px-10 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-bold text-sm shadow-lg hover:bg-[#e09818] transition-all transform hover:scale-105\\\">\\n              Donate Now\\n            </button>\\n            <button className=\\\"bg-white/5 text-white px-10 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-bold text-sm border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all transition-all\\\">\\n              Become a Partner\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nconst Footer = () => {\\n  return (\\n    <footer className=\\\"bg-white py-12 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-12 w-full flex flex-col md:row justify-between items-center gap-8 text-[11px] text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">\\n        <div>\302\251 2026 Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan. District 9125</div>\\n        <div className=\\\"flex gap-8 group\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"#\\\" className=\\\"hover:text-rotary-blue transition-colors\\\">LinkedIn</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"#\\\" className=\\\"hover:text-rotary-blue transition-colors\\\">Instagram</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"#\\\" className=\\\"hover:text-rotary-blue transition-colors\\\">WhatsApp</a>\\n        </div>\\n        <div className=\\\"text-rotary-blue flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-rotaract-gold rounded-full\\\"></span>\\n          Affiliated with Rotary International\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nexport default function App() {\\n  const { scrollYProgress } = useScroll();\\n  const scaleX = useSpring(scrollYProgress, {\\n    stiffness: 100,\\n    damping: 30,\\n    restDelta: 0.001\\n  });\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"font-sans text-brand-dark bg-white subpixel-antialiased\\\">\\n      <motion.div \\n        className=\\\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 h-0.5 bg-rotaract-gold z-[100] origin-left\\\"\\n        style={{ scaleX }}\\n      />\\n      \\n      <Navbar />\\n      \\n      <main>\\n        <Hero />\\n        <Impact />\\n        <About />\\n        <Board />\\n        <Projects />\\n        <Events />\\n        <Donate />\\n      </main>\\n\\n      <Footer />\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating App.tsx with expanded content and features.\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update App.tsx content and features\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
