  planner_response {
    response: "The Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan website has been significantly expanded with several new features and detailed content:\n\n### **New Features & Enhancements:**\n*   **Rotary Connection (About Us):**\n    *   Expanded the \"About Us\" section to explicitly detail the club\'s relationship with **Rotary International** and **District 9125**.\n    *   Added the official **Rotary Logo** with a professional grayscale-to-color hover effect.\n    *   Integrated the **\"Service Above Self\"** motto into a prominent, high-impact visual element.\n*   **Event Details Modal:**\n    *   Implemented a smooth, animated **Modal system** using `AnimatePresence`.\n    *   Clicking any event now reveals a deep-dive view including the exact **Time**, **Venue**, **Detailed Description**, and the **Member Lead** for that activity.\n*   **Professional Board Cards:**\n    *   Replaced placeholder initials with high-quality **Director Cards** featuring portrait images (via professional placeholders), roles, and personal leadership bios.\n    *   Added a **Scale/Glow hover effect** that emphasizes the individual\'s commitment to the club.\n*   **Detailed Project Descriptions:**\n    *   Revamped the Projects section with comprehensive descriptions of our work in **Health**, **Education**, **Environment**, and **Vocational Support**, moving beyond simple bullet points.\n*   **Social Connectivity:**\n    *   Added a dedicated social media suite in the **Footer** with custom-styled icons for **Instagram**, **LinkedIn**, **Twitter**, and a direct **WhatsApp** contact link.\n*   **Polished UX:**\n    *   Enhanced the **Animated Scroll Progress Bar** at the top of the viewport with a gold glow effect (`shadow-[0_0_15px_#F7A81B]`) to guide users as they explore the site.\n\nThe site is now more informative, interactive, and deeply aligned with the global Rotary brand standards."
    modified_response: "The Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan website has been significantly expanded with several new features and detailed content:\n\n### **New Features & Enhancements:**\n*   **Rotary Connection (About Us):**\n    *   Expanded the \"About Us\" section to explicitly detail the club\'s relationship with **Rotary International** and **District 9125**.\n    *   Added the official **Rotary Logo** with a professional grayscale-to-color hover effect.\n    *   Integrated the **\"Service Above Self\"** motto into a prominent, high-impact visual element.\n*   **Event Details Modal:**\n    *   Implemented a smooth, animated **Modal system** using `AnimatePresence`.\n    *   Clicking any event now reveals a deep-dive view including the exact **Time**, **Venue**, **Detailed Description**, and the **Member Lead** for that activity.\n*   **Professional Board Cards:**\n    *   Replaced placeholder initials with high-quality **Director Cards** featuring portrait images (via professional placeholders), roles, and personal leadership bios.\n    *   Added a **Scale/Glow hover effect** that emphasizes the individual\'s commitment to the club.\n*   **Detailed Project Descriptions:**\n    *   Revamped the Projects section with comprehensive descriptions of our work in **Health**, **Education**, **Environment**, and **Vocational Support**, moving beyond simple bullet points.\n*   **Social Connectivity:**\n    *   Added a dedicated social media suite in the **Footer** with custom-styled icons for **Instagram**, **LinkedIn**, **Twitter**, and a direct **WhatsApp** contact link.\n*   **Polished UX:**\n    *   Enhanced the **Animated Scroll Progress Bar** at the top of the viewport with a gold glow effect (`shadow-[0_0_15px_#F7A81B]`) to guide users as they explore the site.\n\nThe site is now more informative, interactive, and deeply aligned with the global Rotary brand standards."
