    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHJ1euZceufUC78JsPQP2q050jRASapJoZvcX3-FxpaB1jQj5kuk5kRGTR4lUY0Ai_VLrf8xlAh9D6OkwvvLeaiyYgC1Av7trfMqd3g-FJbWU2VNMtfQuQVdqc2Y44jbA1hg7x1YdDZzJcrtxMl5RIOcd05IpjVeBDOPLIf5O2D"
      title: "wikimedia.org"
    }
    summary: "Rotary International provides a \"Brand Center\" as a central resource for its brand elements, including logos and graphics[1][2]. This platform allows users to create customized logos for their clubs, districts, or zones, and to download various brand materials[1][2][3][4].\n\nWhile the Brand Center offers different logo file formats like JPG, PNG, EPS, and SVG for download, a direct CDN (Content Delivery Network) public URL for the Rotary International logo is not explicitly provided by Rotary International in the search results[5][3]. The primary method suggested for obtaining official logos is through downloading them directly from their Brand Center.\n\nThird-party websites like Brandfetch also offer Rotary International\'s logo and brand assets in SVG and PNG formats[5][6]. Additionally, a Rotary International logo is available on Wikimedia Commons, though this is a public domain image and not an official CDN link[7].\n\nSources:\n[1] [rotary.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGEHxL6THmMBiwMVU-BjqSX3WLHdd3Yevzk1HT1FV97aFlOY8ZYjIot1xHyBAvYtlPt1ATnsQrFTBDC5c9B2ncmBISA0ki89h6puZVRTRHkb6zI1oSsk3_m8PayXRVyLFyqQJilmPzzvJTycTSbvLsruIwZpCChTQ==)\n[2] [rotary.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHjDLwupg-NQkkg7wxrt5gdjtv0Pl_2jrTY2KpiXjv6gTP7PsA-vM_4j-6zIQteoK28OM2f7HZL-NBKAqiD0FlZNb28PBBbgNHViwuxlF4gQNYP0LIx3qPXFA==)\n[3] [rotary6250.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGxKnh1tzDv7w6_zfix9EGhkBlvDOC94xs2U_PmUggyVhrLiUbhcFUxXVLsO8l1x3I7KxdFQyRwr84w6VRvixa7sxWAQR-5hTBQKxvrSRrwD3j9KDaMu11LxWEa3zbD5M8KQsNr7aRW-KX_kA==)\n[4] [rotary.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHmh0z70AbnzMHov7bvcs2iNhuSZi8ugswIy50b4dtAbewd3Dd_S0PGE-8LZK9A6gfKDtESHj6I7-3hX_hcu0OZRKLJjktXwkfVL0LcrRhzteEOWTFPkvjdmCU-pHaZhb2VtRZUpv_xeQ==)\n[5] [brandfetch.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGue81fn40h-bF