    summary: "The Rotary International logo in a transparent PNG format can be found through various online resources. While a direct public CDN URL is not explicitly provided by Rotary International\'s Brand Center in the search results, several reputable sites offer the logo for download.\n\nYou can download a transparent PNG of the Rotary International logo from:\n\n*   **StickPNG:** This site provides a transparent PNG image of the Rotary logo that can be downloaded for free.[1]\n*   **Seeklogo:** This platform offers the Rotary International logo as a transparent PNG vector.[2]\n*   **CleanPNG:** You can find free transparent PNG images of Rotary International on this site.[3]\n\nFor official branding guidelines and a comprehensive suite of brand assets, including various logo formats, the **Rotary International Brand Center** is the authoritative source. They provide downloadable logos and graphics, and specifically state that PNGs are suitable for digital use with a transparent background.[4][5][6] Access to some assets on the Brand Center might require an account for Rotarians.[7]\n\nSources:\n[1] [stickpng.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFzBDFidEiV_jbvEjGBueu0H9w8L-4eVgVDzMPDZs53zN1lNqDjxihFPtV-QnBeF1L9Dxl0KUE1WsKYYjGJZcIL0rfnvyy73BrPKm9lSNgmnAs4TmxI1BPeNW0H1z_WhYO4ltHor1FKhLvE6_LF9nEpoUcCu8m4r2XjvHN-jy0wP4Z_RGc=)\n[2] [seeklogo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEnlxRFX-gFCzjvIXkkcUJs9ccmlj6bLQeojjDRH1uRhdv-EvVoUJ0NiQRhu21BncNJms7Tl8cOF6aMUTSITIkN47JKa_BuV-1fpy2LPBcWwsskLOQn8WF6cHlwCXL4EIh96K9PepsTyMAKtpNEYJd7X8IY6HQAbg==)\n[3] [cleanpng.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHBS2PEqPSDrUe5zd5v8N0nmPJLTZMBRSIkPGGi_Qh4I5XR7AwZVGoZoDlt0zNMRWie25GoEgHSBX8wzgW4b9HKW7xMrv31EwfOICm3NXvi1GNRXLn0JQZR7bR6sf8gXfsbODmUFaO35EbZdE1z5sSCJwo=)\n[4] [rotary.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEJ_KW7QS9SXZvCkb_63k0ETOI3h7LnkcqzZ1onCAGW-3rfS4RUEpBIW-YLcKz73zQGkY3rVcsO452JLd8z9Aoal1mRLpR1nZJly6yLWCI4191-VjrecMQFsy4=)\n[5] [rotary.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGjpTU2MoYqLw6sbqRk29_SVtlGaD-dJGKj6azOKOB0LPignB6Uif91jEDs1sLqeoPTBtmPNQdjOTRF3AB7MjD2RvvV-VJZF47-et1_vQz9iO-XU2BXVs5OzKr6JD05rHIhn_fQZvk1CSvEM7_wlEJeBLKJ2uyCwYg=)\n[6] [rotary.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFju-t82-JTjS-Dv6wXWJu9UANMV1d_qj2QWDQv4NQDMy_vY9GpXynT_UMwO2ifgfVJqeaua0Ic0hiKo5V5TXaa6iuFfpLMDGBw9BEv_q-0KwbPRPTlHUJnL42HLJrhnUhIZGuNTTVsGXkMlKqbfAo_U4xNdjXQo9tswA==)\n[7] [sfrotary.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQExHm9jVz3csHDJqCFjsgZvUTzfu0hbWL7K7MYrVmt6_S6Mh8eI4z0R0Qk_6IT70rZ9vNu0vC1Hs2HK0Ws5FikaBmVET1bxKMqVa9OVJ078r5nyhId2cXbx33zwoSUWPULHTwiwe5YD9RMswZA=)"
