y-1 rounded mb-6 uppercase\\\">\\n            Service Above Self \302\267 Ibadan, Nigeria\\n          </span>\\n\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating Hero logo with a more direct image link and simpler animation.\", \"toolSummary\":\"Fix Hero logo and animation\"}"
