    user_requests: "Here is the full initial file tree for the application:\n/.env.example\n/.gitignore\n/index.html\n/metadata.json\n/package.json\n/src/App.tsx\n/src/index.css\n/src/main.tsx\n/tsconfig.json\n/vite.config.ts\n\nThe following dependencies are installed:\n@google/genai: ^1.29.0\n@tailwindcss/vite: ^4.1.14\n@vitejs/plugin-react: ^5.0.4\ndotenv: ^17.2.3\nexpress: ^4.21.2\nlucide-react: ^0.546.0\nmotion: ^12.23.24\nreact: ^19.0.0\nreact-dom: ^19.0.0\nvite: ^6.2.0\n\nThe following devDependencies are installed:\n@types/express: ^4.17.21\n@types/node: ^22.14.0\nautoprefixer: ^10.4.21\ntailwindcss: ^4.1.14\ntsx: ^4.21.0\ntypescript: ~5.8.2\nvite: ^6.2.0\n\nKey file contents:\n\n--- /.env.example ---\n```\n# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for Gemini AI API calls.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets.\n# Users configure this via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI.\nGEMINI_API_KEY=\"MY_GEMINI_API_KEY\"\n\n# APP_URL: The URL where this applet is hosted.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.\n# Used for self-referential links, OAuth callbacks, and API endpoints.\nAPP_URL=\"MY_APP_URL\"\n\n```\n\n--- /index.html ---\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>My Google AI Studio App</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div id=\"root\"></div>\n    <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.tsx\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n\n\n```\n\n--- /metadata.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"\",\n  \"description\": \"\",\n  \"requestFramePermissions\": [],\n  \"majorCapabilities\": []\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /src/App.tsx ---\n```typescript\n/**\n * @license\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\n */\n\nexport default function App() {\n  return <div></div>;\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /src/index.css ---\n```css\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n```\n\n--- /src/main.tsx ---\n```typescript\nimport {StrictMode} from \'react\';\nimport {createRoot} from \'react-dom/client\';\nimport App from \'./App.tsx\';\nimport \'./index.css\';\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById(\'root\')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n  </StrictMode>,\n);\n\n```\n\n--- /tsconfig.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"experimentalDecorators\": true,\n    \"useDefineForClassFields\": false,\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"lib\": [\n      \"ES2022\",\n      \"DOM\",\n      \"DOM.Iterable\"\n    ],\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"moduleDetection\": \"force\",\n    \"allowJs\": true,\n    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\n        \"./*\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"allowImportingTsExtensions\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true\n  }\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /vite.config.ts ---\n```typescript\nimport tailwindcss from \'@tailwindcss/vite\';\nimport react from \'@vitejs/plugin-react\';\nimport path from \'path\';\nimport {defineConfig, loadEnv} from \'vite\';\n\nexport default defineConfig(({mode}) => {\n  const env = loadEnv(mode, \'.\', \'\');\n  return {\n    plugins: [react(), tailwindcss()],\n    define: {\n      \'process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY\': JSON.stringify(env.GEMINI_API_KEY),\n    },\n    resolve: {\n      alias: {\n        \'@\': path.resolve(__dirname, \'.\'),\n      },\n    },\n    server: {\n      // HMR is disabled in AI Studio via DISABLE_HMR env var.\n      // Do not modify\303\242\302\200\302\224file watching is disabled to prevent flickering during agent edits.\n      hmr: process.env.DISABLE_HMR !== \'true\',\n    },\n  };\n});\n\n```"
    user_requests: "You are a senior frontend engineer and UI/UX designer specializing in nonprofit and \ncommunity organization websites. Your work is benchmarked against award-winning sites. \nlike the Obama Foundation (2025 Webby Award Winner), Giving Kitchen (WebAward Best \nNonprofit), and charity: water\342\200\224not generic template sites. It should all be done in Next.js\n\n---\n\n## PROJECT BRIEF\n\nBuild a complete, production-ready website for:\n\n**Organization:** Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan\n**Type:** Community service and youth leadership club under Rotary International\n**Location:** Ibadan, Nigeria\n**Audience:** Young professionals (18\342\200\22330), potential donors, partner organizations, \nsponsors, and the general public\n**Goal:** Establish a strong digital presence that communicates mission, showcases \nimpact, drives donations, and attracts partnerships\n\n---\n\n## DELIVERABLE\n\nA single, self-contained HTML file with embedded CSS and JavaScript. \nNo external dependencies except Google Fonts and Font Awesome (CDN links allowed). \nNo frameworks. Pure HTML, CSS (with CSS variables), and vanilla JS.\n\nThe site must be:\n- Fully responsive (mobile-first)\n- Smooth scrolling with clean section transitions\n- Visually excellent \342\200\224 NOT a generic template. Every section must feel intentional.\n- Fast loading \342\200\224 no heavy animations, no bloat\n\n---\n\n## BRAND IDENTITY\n\n**Primary Color:** Royal Blue \342\200\224 #003F87 (Rotary International brand color)\n**Accent Color:** Gold \342\200\224 #F7A81B (Rotaract accent)\n**Background:** #FFFFFF with subtle off-white sections (#F8F9FA)\n**Text:** #1A1A2E for headings, #4A4A68 for body\n**Font:** Use \"Inter\" from Google Fonts for all text\n\nVisual rule: The site must feel premium and modern. Think clean whitespace, \nstrong typographic hierarchy, and purposeful use of the blue/gold brand palette. \nNot corporate, not stuffy \342\200\224 it should feel like a club run by sharp, driven young \npeople who take their service seriously.\n\n---\n\n## PAGES / SECTIONS (single-page layout with anchor navigation)\n\nBuild the following sections in this exact order:\n\n### 1. NAVIGATION (sticky)\n- Logo text: \"Rotaract Ring Road\" in bold (blue)\n- Nav links: Home | About | Board | Projects | Events | Partner | Donate\n- \"Donate\" is a gold CTA button, always visible\n- Mobile: hamburger menu with smooth slide-down drawer\n- On scroll: navbar gets a white background with subtle shadow\n\n### 2. HERO SECTION\n- Full-width, bold. NOT a stock image background. Use a solid deep blue (#003F87) \n  with a subtle geometric pattern overlay (CSS-generated dots or diagonal lines).\n- Left side: \n  - Small tag: \"Service Above Self \302\267 Ibadan, Nigeria\"\n  - Large headline (60px+): \"Young Leaders. Real Service. Lasting Impact.\"\n  - Subheading: \"Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan empowers young professionals to \n    take action in their communities and lead meaningful change.\"\n  - Two CTAs: [Get Involved \342\206\222] (white, filled) and [Our Projects] (white, outlined)\n- Right side: A CSS-illustrated or SVG abstract composition \342\200\224 layered cards, \n  circles, lines \342\200\224 in blue and gold. Suggest something geometric that conveys \n  community and connection. Do not use placeholder images.\n- Scroll indicator at the bottom\n\n### 3. IMPACT NUMBERS (full-width strip, blue background, gold accents)\nFour stats displayed in a clean row:\n- 50+ Members\n- 12+ Projects Completed\n- 1000+ Lives Impacted\n- 5+ Years of Service\n\nLarge animated counter numbers (count up on scroll into view using IntersectionObserver).\nEach stat has a small gold icon above it.\n\n### 4. ABOUT US\nTwo-column layout:\n- Left: Section label + large heading + 2\342\200\2233 paragraphs about the club \342\200\224 its mission, \n  its connection to Rotary International, its focus on youth service, community \n  development, and leadership in Ibadan.\n- Right: A stack of three \"value cards\" in blue/gold \342\200\224 \"Community\", \"Leadership\", \n  \"Service\" \342\200\224 each with a short one-liner and an icon.\n- Below: A blue strip with the Rotary motto \"Service Above Self\" in large italic gold text.\n\n### 5. BOARD OF DIRECTORS\nSection title: \"Meet the Board\"\nSubtitle: \"The 2025\342\200\2232026 leadership team driving our mission forward.\"\n\nDisplay board members as professional cards in a 3-column grid (2 on tablet, 1 on mobile):\nEach card has:\n- A circular avatar placeholder (styled with initials in blue/gold)\n- Name (bold)\n- Role/Title\n- Short one-liner bio\n\nPre-populate with these actual board members (use real titles, invent professional \none-liner bios appropriate for each role):\n- President: [President Name \342\200\224 to be filled in]\n- Vice President & Secretary: Rtr. King Praise\n- Welfare Director: [Name \342\200\224 to be filled in]\n- (Add 3 more placeholder board members for completeness)\n\nStyle the President card slightly larger or with a gold border to denote leadership.\n\n### 6. PAST PROJECTS\nSection title: \"Our Impact in Action\"\nSubtitle: \"A snapshot of the work we\'ve done in Ibadan and beyond.\"\n\nDisplay 6 project cards in a 3-column grid (CSS Grid):\nEach card:\n- Icon (relevant Font Awesome icon, gold)\n- Project name (bold, blue)\n- Short description (2 lines)\n- A \"View More\" link (no destination needed)\n- Subtle hover state: card lifts with shadow, gold top border appears\n\nProject categories to cover (invent appropriate names):\n- Health & Wellness\n- Education Outreach\n- Environmental Action\n- Youth Empowerment\n- Community Development\n- Vocational Support\n\n### 7. EVENTS / NEWS\nSection title: \"What\'s Coming\"\nDisplay the next 3 upcoming events as horizontal cards:\n- Date badge (blue, bold)\n- Event name\n- Short description\n- Lead name\n- [Add to Calendar] button (placeholder)\n\nPre-populate with the actual confirmed events:\n1. May 10, 2026 \342\200\224 Club Meeting (Lead: Rtr. King Praise)\n2. May 24, 2026 \342\200\224 Joint Fellowship (Lead: Rtr. Risqat)\n3. June 13, 2026 \342\200\224 Rotary Fellowship Meeting (Lead: Rtr. Toffy)\n\n### 8. PARTNER WITH US\nTwo-column card layout:\nLeft card (blue background):\n- Title: \"Become a Partner\"\n- Text: For organizations looking to collaborate on community impact projects, \n  sponsor events, or align their brand with youth leadership in Ibadan.\n- CTA: [Partner With Us]\n\nRight card (gold/light background):\n- Title: \"Volunteer With Us\"\n- Text: Join our community of action. Whether you\'re a Rotaractor or not, \n  there\'s a place for you in our work.\n- CTA: [Get Involved]\n\n### 9. DONATE\nFull-width section, dark blue background, centered:\n- Headline: \"Your Support Drives Real Change\"\n- Subtext: \"Every contribution funds a project, equips a young leader, \n  or serves a community in need.\"\n- Three giving tiers displayed as cards:\n  - \342\202\2465,000 \342\200\224 \"Community Friend\"\n  - \342\202\24620,000 \342\200\224 \"Impact Partner\"\n  - \342\202\24650,000 \342\200\224 \"Champion of Service\"\n  Each card has a short note on what the amount achieves.\n- Large gold CTA button: [Donate Now]\n- Note below: \"Secure giving. Every naira is accounted for.\"\n\n### 10. FOOTER\nThree columns:\n- Column 1: Club name + tagline + social icons (Instagram, LinkedIn, X/Twitter, WhatsApp)\n- Column 2: Quick links (mirror the nav)\n- Column 3: Contact info \342\200\224 Ibadan, Nigeria | Email placeholder | Phone placeholder\nBottom strip: \"\302\251 2026 Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan. District 9125 | Affiliated \nwith Rotary International\"\n\n---\n\n## INTERACTION & ANIMATION RULES\n\n- All sections fade-in on scroll using IntersectionObserver (subtle, not distracting)\n- Impact counter animates upward on scroll\n- Project cards have hover lift effect\n- Nav link has active underline tracking current section\n- Smooth scroll to section on nav link click\n- Mobile hamburger menu toggles cleanly\n- No carousels. No auto-playing anything.\n\n---\n\n## WHAT TO AVOID\n\n- No stock photo placeholders with broken images \342\200\224 use CSS/SVG visuals instead\n- No Lorem Ipsum \342\200\224 write real, appropriate placeholder text for a Nigerian Rotaract club\n- No generic bootstrap-looking layout\n- No more than 3 font weights\n- No gradient overload \342\200\224 use solid brand colors deliberately\n- Do not use inline event handlers \342\200\224 use addEventListener throughout\n\n---\n\n## OUTPUT FORMAT\n\nReturn the complete HTML file only. No explanation before or after. \nStart with <!DOCTYPE html> and end with </html>. \nThe code must work by opening the file directly in a browser with zero setup."
    user_requests: "You are a senior frontend engineer and UI/UX designer specializing in nonprofit and\ncommunity organization websites. Your work is benchmarked against award-winning sites.\nlike the Obama Foundation (2025 Webby Award Winner), Giving Kitchen (WebAward Best\nNonprofit), and charity: water\342\200\224not generic template sites. It should all be done in Next.js\nPROJECT BRIEF\nBuild a complete, production-ready website for:\nOrganization: Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan\nType: Community service and youth leadership club under Rotary International\nLocation: Ibadan, Nigeria\nAudience: Young professionals (18\342\200\22330), potential donors, partner organizations,\nsponsors, and the general public\nGoal: Establish a strong digital presence that communicates mission, showcases\nimpact, drives donations, and attracts partnerships\nDELIVERABLE\nA single, self-contained HTML file with embedded CSS and JavaScript.\nNo external dependencies except Google Fonts and Font Awesome (CDN links allowed).\nNo frameworks. Pure HTML, CSS (with CSS variables), and vanilla JS.\nThe site must be:\nFully responsive (mobile-first)\nSmooth scrolling with clean section transitions\nVisually excellent \342\200\224 NOT a generic template. Every section must feel intentional.\nFast loading \342\200\224 no heavy animations, no bloat\nBRAND IDENTITY\nPrimary Color: Royal Blue \342\200\224 #003F87 (Rotary International brand color)\nAccent Color: Gold \342\200\224 #F7A81B (Rotaract accent)\nBackground: #FFFFFF with subtle off-white sections (#F8F9FA)\nText: #1A1A2E for headings, #4A4A68 for body\nFont: Use \"Inter\" from Google Fonts for all text\nVisual rule: The site must feel premium and modern. Think clean whitespace,\nstrong typographic hierarchy, and purposeful use of the blue/gold brand palette.\nNot corporate, not stuffy \342\200\224 it should feel like a club run by sharp, driven young\npeople who take their service seriously.\nPAGES / SECTIONS (single-page layout with anchor navigation)\nBuild the following sections in this exact order:\n1. NAVIGATION (sticky)\nLogo text: \"Rotaract Ring Road\" in bold (blue)\nNav links: Home | About | Board | Projects | Events | Partner | Donate\n\"Donate\" is a gold CTA button, always visible\nMobile: hamburger menu with smooth slide-down drawer\nOn scroll: navbar gets a white background with subtle shadow\n2. HERO SECTION\nFull-width, bold. NOT a stock image background. Use a solid deep blue (#003F87)\nwith a subtle geometric pattern overlay (CSS-generated dots or diagonal lines).\nLeft side:\nSmall tag: \"Service Above Self \302\267 Ibadan, Nigeria\"\nLarge headline (60px+): \"Young Leaders. Real Service. Lasting Impact.\"\nSubheading: \"Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan empowers young professionals to\ntake action in their communities and lead meaningful change.\"\nTwo CTAs: [Get Involved \342\206\222] (white, filled) and [Our Projects] (white, outlined)\nRight side: A CSS-illustrated or SVG abstract composition \342\200\224 layered cards,\ncircles, lines \342\200\224 in blue and gold. Suggest something geometric that conveys\ncommunity and connection. Do not use placeholder images.\nScroll indicator at the bottom\n3. IMPACT NUMBERS (full-width strip, blue background, gold accents)\nFour stats displayed in a clean row:\n50+ Members\n12+ Projects Completed\n1000+ Lives Impacted\n5+ Years of Service\nLarge animated counter numbers (count up on scroll into view using IntersectionObserver).\nEach stat has a small gold icon above it.\n4. ABOUT US\nTwo-column layout:\nLeft: Section label + large heading + 2\342\200\2233 paragraphs about the club \342\200\224 its mission,\nits connection to Rotary International, its focus on youth service, community\ndevelopment, and leadership in Ibadan.\nRight: A stack of three \"value cards\" in blue/gold \342\200\224 \"Community\", \"Leadership\",\n\"Service\" \342\200\224 each with a short one-liner and an icon.\nBelow: A blue strip with the Rotary motto \"Service Above Self\" in large italic gold text.\n5. BOARD OF DIRECTORS\nSection title: \"Meet the Board\"\nSubtitle: \"The 2025\342\200\2232026 leadership team driving our mission forward.\"\nDisplay board members as professional cards in a 3-column grid (2 on tablet, 1 on mobile):\nEach card has:\nA circular avatar placeholder (styled with initials in blue/gold)\nName (bold)\nRole/Title\nShort one-liner bio\nPre-populate with these actual board members (use real titles, invent professional\none-liner bios appropriate for each role):\nPresident: [President Name \342\200\224 to be filled in]\nVice President & Secretary: Rtr. King Praise\nWelfare Director: [Name \342\200\224 to be filled in]\n(Add 3 more placeholder board members for completeness)\nStyle the President card slightly larger or with a gold border to denote leadership.\n6. PAST PROJECTS\nSection title: \"Our Impact in Action\"\nSubtitle: \"A snapshot of the work we\'ve done in Ibadan and beyond.\"\nDisplay 6 project cards in a 3-column grid (CSS Grid):\nEach card:\nIcon (relevant Font Awesome icon, gold)\nProject name (bold, blue)\nShort description (2 lines)\nA \"View More\" link (no destination needed)\nSubtle hover state: card lifts with shadow, gold top border appears\nProject categories to cover (invent appropriate names):\nHealth & Wellness\nEducation Outreach\nEnvironmental Action\nYouth Empowerment\nCommunity Development\nVocational Support\n7. EVENTS / NEWS\nSection title: \"What\'s Coming\"\nDisplay the next 3 upcoming events as horizontal cards:\nDate badge (blue, bold)\nEvent name\nShort description\nLead name\n[Add to Calendar] button (placeholder)\nPre-populate with the actual confirmed events:\nMay 10, 2026 \342\200\224 Club Meeting (Lead: Rtr. King Praise)\nMay 24, 2026 \342\200\224 Joint Fellowship (Lead: Rtr. Risqat)\nJune 13, 2026 \342\200\224 Rotary Fellowship Meeting (Lead: Rtr. Toffy)\n8. PARTNER WITH US\nTwo-column card layout:\nLeft card (blue background):\nTitle: \"Become a Partner\"\nText: For organizations looking to collaborate on community impact projects,\nsponsor events, or align their brand with youth leadership in Ibadan.\nCTA: [Partner With Us]\nRight card (gold/light background):\nTitle: \"Volunteer With Us\"\nText: Join our community of action. Whether you\'re a Rotaractor or not,\nthere\'s a place for you in our work.\nCTA: [Get Involved]\n9. DONATE\nFull-width section, dark blue background, centered:\nHeadline: \"Your Support Drives Real Change\"\nSubtext: \"Every contribution funds a project, equips a young leader,\nor serves a community in need.\"\nThree giving tiers displayed as cards:\n\342\202\2465,000 \342\200\224 \"Community Friend\"\n\342\202\24620,000 \342\200\224 \"Impact Partner\"\n\342\202\24650,000 \342\200\224 \"Champion of Service\"\nEach card has a short note on what the amount achieves.\nLarge gold CTA button: [Donate Now]\nNote below: \"Secure giving. Every naira is accounted for.\"\n10. FOOTER\nThree columns:\nColumn 1: Club name + tagline + social icons (Instagram, LinkedIn, X/Twitter, WhatsApp)\nColumn 2: Quick links (mirror the nav)\nColumn 3: Contact info \342\200\224 Ibadan, Nigeria | Email placeholder | Phone placeholder\nBottom strip: \"\302\251 2026 Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan. District 9125 | Affiliated\nwith Rotary International\"\nINTERACTION & ANIMATION RULES\nAll sections fade-in on scroll using IntersectionObserver (subtle, not distracting)\nImpact counter animates upward on scroll\nProject cards have hover lift effect\nNav link has active underline tracking current section\nSmooth scroll to section on nav link click\nMobile hamburger menu toggles cleanly\nNo carousels. No auto-playing anything.\nWHAT TO AVOID\nNo stock photo placeholders with broken images \342\200\224 use CSS/SVG visuals instead\nNo Lorem Ipsum \342\200\224 write real, appropriate placeholder text for a Nigerian Rotaract club\nNo generic bootstrap-looking layout\nNo more than 3 font weights\nNo gradient overload \342\200\224 use solid brand colors deliberately\nDo not use inline event handlers \342\200\224 use addEventListener throughout\nOUTPUT FORMAT\nLet it be in Next.js or Nest.js \n\nThe code must work by opening the file directly in a browser with zero setup."
    user_requests: "Apply the \"Professional Polish\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Professional Polish\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html>\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-white text-[#1A1A2E] font-sans overflow-hidden flex flex-col shadow-2xl\\\">\\n  <nav class=\\\"h-20 bg-white border-b border-gray-100 px-10 flex items-center justify-between sticky top-0 z-50\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#003F87] tracking-tight\\\">\\n      Rotaract <span class=\\\"text-[#F7A81B]\\\">Ring Road</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-8 font-medium text-sm text-[#4A4A68]\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"text-[#003F87] border-b-2 border-[#003F87] pb-1\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-[#003F87] transition-colors\\\">About</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-[#003F87] transition-colors\\\">Board</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-[#003F87] transition-colors\\\">Projects</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-[#003F87] transition-colors\\\">Events</a>\\n      <button class=\\\"bg-[#F7A81B] text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full font-bold shadow-md hover:bg-[#e09818] transition-all\\\">\\n        Donate\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <main class=\\\"w-2/3 overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"relative h-[420px] bg-[#003F87] flex items-center px-12 text-white\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10\\\" style=\\\"background-image: radial-gradient(#fff 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 20px 20px;\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"z-10 w-full flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"max-w-md\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"inline-block bg-[#F7A81B] text-[#003F87] text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded mb-6 uppercase\\\">\\n              Service Above Self \302\267 Ibadan, Nigeria\\n            </span>\\n            <h1 class=\\\"text-5xl font-extrabold leading-[1.1] mb-6 tracking-tight\\\">\\n              Young Leaders. <br/>Real Service. <br/>Lasting Impact.\\n            </h1>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-blue-100 text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed font-light\\\">\\n              Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan empowers young professionals to take action in their communities.\\n            </p>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"bg-white text-[#003F87] px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold flex items-center shadow-lg\\\">Get Involved <span class=\\\"ml-2\\\">\342\206\222</span></button>\\n              <button class=\\\"border-2 border-white/30 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-white/10\\\">Our Projects</button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"relative w-48 h-48\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#F7A81B] rounded-full opacity-20 animate-pulse\\\"></div>\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 100 100\\\" class=\\\"w-full h-full text-white fill-current opacity-80\\\">\\n              <circle cx=\\\"50\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"40\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"0.5\\\"/>\\n              <path d=\\\"M50 10 L50 90 M10 50 L90 50 M20 20 L80 80 M80 20 L20 80\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"0.5\\\"/>\\n            </svg>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"bg-[#F7A81B] h-24 flex items-center justify-around px-12\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-2xl font-black text-[#003F87]\\\">50+</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-[#003F87]/70 tracking-widest\\\">Members</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"h-8 w-px bg-[#003F87]/20\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-2xl font-black text-[#003F87]\\\">12+</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-[#003F87]/70 tracking-widest\\\">Projects</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"h-8 w-px bg-[#003F87]/20\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-2xl font-black text-[#003F87]\\\">1000+</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-[#003F87]/70 tracking-widest\\\">Lives Impacted</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"h-8 w-px bg-[#003F87]/20\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-2xl font-black text-[#003F87]\\\">5+</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-[#003F87]/70 tracking-widest\\\">Years</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"flex-1 bg-[#F8F9FA] p-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-10\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#F7A81B]\\\">Impact in Action</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-3\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-[#F7A81B] shadow-sm\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"font-bold text-[#003F87]\\\">Health & Wellness</div>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs text-[#4A4A68] mt-1\\\">Providing medical screenings and sanitation awareness in Ibadan.</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-[#003F87] shadow-sm\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"font-bold text-[#003F87]\\\">Education Outreach</div>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs text-[#4A4A68] mt-1\\\">Equipping local schools with stationary and digital learning tools.</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center p-6 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-100\\\">\\n           <div class=\\\"italic font-serif text-2xl text-[#003F87] mb-2\\\">\\\"Service Above Self\\\"</div>\\n           <div class=\\\"text-[#F7A81B] font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-tighter\\\">The Rotary Motto</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-1/3 border-l border-gray-100 bg-white p-8 flex flex-col gap-8\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#003F87] mb-6 flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n          The Board\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-normal\\\">2025\342\200\2232026</span>\\n        </h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border-2 border-[#F7A81B]\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#003F87] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm\\\">JO</div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-xs font-bold\\\">Rtr. John Olumide</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#F7A81B] font-bold uppercase\\\">President</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 p-3 rounded-2xl hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gray-200 text-[#003F87] flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm\\\">KP</div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-xs font-bold\\\">Rtr. King Praise</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#4A4A68]\\\">VP & Secretary</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#003F87] mb-4\\\">Upcoming Events</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-[#003F87]\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold\\\">May</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-lg font-black leading-none\\\">10</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-xs font-bold\\\">Club Meeting</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#4A4A68]\\\">Lead: Rtr. King Praise</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-[#003F87]\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold\\\">Jun</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-lg font-black leading-none\\\">13</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-xs font-bold\\\">Fellowship Meeting</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#4A4A68]\\\">Lead: Rtr. Toffy</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-auto\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-[#1A1A2E] rounded-2xl p-6 text-white text-center shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-16 h-16 bg-[#F7A81B] -mr-8 -mt-8 rounded-full opacity-20\\\"></div>\\n          <h4 class=\\\"text-sm font-bold mb-2\\\">Fuel Our Projects</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 mb-4 px-4\\\">Every naira supports community health and youth literacy in Ibadan.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"w-full bg-[#F7A81B] py-2 rounded-lg font-bold text-xs shadow-lg\\\">Donate Now</button>\\n            <button class=\\\"w-full bg-white/5 py-2 rounded-lg font-bold text-xs\\\">Be a Partner</button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-12 bg-white border-t border-gray-100 px-10 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-medium\\\">\\n    <div>\302\251 2026 Rotaract Club of Ring Road Ibadan. District 9125</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-6 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">LinkedIn</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Instagram</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">WhatsApp</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"text-[#003F87] font-bold\\\">Affiliated with Rotary International</div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
