try a more reliable URL from vhv.rs and Wikimedia. I\'m also considering a text-based logo if the user prefers that as a fallback. I\'ll test Placeholder.com, and I might try removing `referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\"` to address cross-origin issues.\n\n\n"
