  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Extracting Board Data**\n\nI\'m now focused on the initial extraction. My plan involves pulling the Board member information directly from the OCR output. Once I have that data, I\'ll update the `members` array within `App.tsx` accordingly.\n\n\n**Verifying Board Member List**\n\nI\'ve verified the \"Board\" section now contains the complete list of nine members, as per the \"INTRODUCTION OF THE BODs\" section. I have extracted the Board member information from OCR page 1. The data now includes names and titles, and other relevant information. This ensures the correct and current board member information is available, which will be incorporated into the `Board` component.\n\n\n**Refining Member Biographies**\n\nI\'m now refining the biographies for each board member, ensuring they are concise yet informative. I\'m focusing on their name, role, a brief professional summary, and a Dicebear avatar based on their name. I\'m prioritizing accuracy and relevance in these descriptions. The goal is to accurately represent each member and their contributions.\n\n\n**Confirming Board Structure**\n\nI\'m now assessing the layout for the nine board members. The current grid configuration seems sufficient, so I\'m confirming that the grid layout adapts well with nine members. I\'m taking a close look at the grid structure to ensure it renders all nine members effectively across different screen sizes. I also noted that Raji Habeeb Adekola, the DRRE, may not be a club member.\n\n\n**Validating Board Roster**\n\nI\'m now validating the board roster using the introduction to the BODs section as the definitive source. I have confirmed the nine members listed there are the correct ones to include. I\'m updating my data to reflect this, including verifying their names and titles directly from the document. I will replace the previous president name with Rtr. Samuel Popoola. My mock data will be updated accordingly. I\'m also adding a new bio for Samuel: \"A Poultry Site Engineer and Publisher dedicated to leading the club with excellence and vision.\" I will continue to work on the other bios.\n\n\n**Compiling Board Member Bios**\n\nI\'m now integrating the new member biographies. I\'ve compiled concise descriptions for all the remaining board members, capturing their roles and key contributions. I\'m focusing on accuracy and professionalism in these descriptions, and this information will be seamlessly added to the `members` array. I will ensure all members have accurate bios now, and I will be verifying that the names are all correct.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "c20hrm0m"
      name: "edit_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Instruction\":\"Update the Board of Directors section with the authentic names, roles, and bios extracted from the meeting minutes PDF.\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"const Board = () => {\\n  const members = [\\n    { \\n      name: \'Rtr. Popoola Samuel\', \\n      role: \'President\', \\n      isLead: true, \\n      bio: \'A Poultry Site Engineer and Publisher dedicated to leading the club with excellence and vision.\',\\n      image: \'https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/avataaars/svg?seed=Samuel&backgroundColor=b6e3f4\'\\n    },\\n    { \\n      name: \'Rtr. Taiwo King Praise\', \\n      role: \'Vice President & Secretary\', \\n      isLead: false, \\n      bio: \'Software Engineer and founder of Code Dynasty ICT solutions. A Mathematics graduate and strategic administrator.\',\\n      image: \'https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/avataaars/svg?seed=Praise&backgroundColor=c0aede\'\\n    },\\n    { \\n      name: \'Rtr. Adejemo Risqat\', \\n      role: \'Immediate Past President & Project Director\', \\n      isLead: false, \\n      bio: \'Transitioning leader, tech professional at Red Cloud Technology, and dedicated commercial vegetable farmer.\',\\n      image: \'https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/avataaars/svg?seed=Risqat&backgroundColor=ffdfbf\'\\n    },\\n    { \\n      name: \'Rtr. Akinsoroju Tunmininu\', \\n      role: \'Treasurer\', \\n      isLead: false, \\n      bio: \'Professional Medical Laboratory Scientist ensuring the club\\\\\'s financial integrity and transparent reporting.\',\\n      image: \'https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/avataaars/svg?seed=Tunmininu&backgroundColor=d1d4f9\'\\n    },\\n    { \\n      name: \'Rtr. Oluwatofunmi Tejumola\', \\n      role: \'Club Trainer\', \\n      isLead: false, \\n      bio: \'Professional graphics designer and branding expert dedicated to membership development and training.\',\\n      image: \'https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/avataaars/svg?seed=Tejumola&backgroundColor=ffd5dc\'\\n    },\\n    { \\n      name: \'Rtr. Ayanfe Adesanya\', \\n      role: \'Public Relations Media Officer\', \\n      isLead: false, \\n      bio: \'Chairman of LD Groups and brand voice expert, leading our external communications and public image.\',\\n      image: \'https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/avataaars/svg?seed=Ayanfe&backgroundColor=b6e3f4\'\\n    },\\n    { \\n      name: \'Rtr. Pelayanju Omotayo\', \\n      role: \'Public Media Officer\', \\n      isLead: false, \\n      bio: \'Cybersecurity and Penetration Hacking specialist focusing on our digital outreach and platform security.\',\\n      image: \'https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/avataaars/svg?seed=Omotayo&backgroundColor=c0aede\'\\n    },\\n    { \\n      name: \'Rtr. Justinah Olawuyi\', \\n      role: \'Club Welfare Officer\', \\n      isLead: false, \\n      bio: \'Final-year student dedicated to the holistic well-being and social support of all club members.\',\\n      image: \'https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/avataaars/svg?seed=Justinah&backgroundColor=ffdfbf\'\\n    },\\n    { \\n      name: \'Rtr. Oluwatoke Anita\', \\n      role: \'Club Admin\', \\n      isLead: false, \\n      bio: \'Student entrepreneur and perfume specialist managing our administrative core and member coordination.\',\\n      image: \'https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/avataaars/svg?seed=Anita&backgroundColor=ffd5dc\'\\n    },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"board\\\" className=\\\"py-24 bg-brand-bg border-t border-gray-100\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-12\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"text-center mb-16\\\">\\n          <h2 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-rotaract-gold mb-3\\\">Leadership</h2>\\n          <h3 className=\\\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-rotary-blue tracking-tight italic\\\">The 2025\342\200\2232026 Board of Directors</h3>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\\\">\\n          {members.map((m, i) => (\\n            <motion.div \\n           