  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Locating \"Unite for Good\"**\n\nI\'m currently identifying the optimal placement for \"Unite for Good.\" I\'m leaning toward positioning it strategically, possibly directly after the \"Impact/Counter\" section or before the \"Board of\" section, to give the 2025-26 Rotary year a noticeable theme. My focus is ensuring it is prominent and integrates well with the current structure.\n\n\n**Defining the Theme Section**\n\nI\'ve decided to create a dedicated \"YearTheme\" section to showcase \"Unite for Good.\" I\'m aiming for a visually striking 3D effect using `text-shadow` in a larger font. I\'ll employ Framer Motion to animate it, adding depth and dynamic appeal. The plan is to insert this new section directly after the \"Impact\" section, creating a seamless flow before \"About.\" I\'ll be implementing this addition soon.\n\n\n"
