    response: "I have updated the application with the new official address and integrated the branding logo you provided:\n\n### **Key Branding & Information Updates:**\n- **Official Address:** You can now find the club\'s physical location prominently displayed in the **Footer** under the \"Service Above Self\" motto:  \n  *Panthers Hub, Familusi Avenue, Iyaganku, Ibadan.*  \n  I\342\200\231ve added a subtle gold `MapPin` icon to make it visually distinct and easy to locate.\n- **Navbar Logo Integration:** I\342\200\231ve updated the navigation bar to lead with your uploaded logo. \n  - **Artistic Touch:** The logo now features a soft gold glow effect when the navbar is transparent, which gracefully fades out as you scroll to maintain a clean aesthetic.\n  - **Hover Dynamics:** The logo subtly scales up on hover to provide a premium, interactive feel.\n  - **Reliability:** I\'ve implemented a **smart fallback system**. If for any reason the image file (`logo.png`) isn\'t found in the project root, the navbar will automatically revert to the elegant typographic branding we created earlier, ensuring the site never looks broken.\n\n**Note:** To ensure the logo displays correctly, please make sure the image file is named **`logo.png`** and uploaded to your project\'s root directory.\n\nThe website now feels complete, professional, and perfectly aligned with the club\'s physical and digital identity!"
    modified_response: "I have updated the application with the new official address and integrated the branding logo you provided:\n\n### **Key Branding & Information Updates:**\n- **Official Address:** You can now find the club\'s physical location prominently displayed in the **Footer** under the \"Service Above Self\" motto:  \n  *Panthers Hub, Familusi Avenue, Iyaganku, Ibadan.*  \n  I\342\200\231ve added a subtle gold `MapPin` icon to make it visually distinct and easy to locate.\n- **Navbar Logo Integration:** I\342\200\231ve updated the navigation bar to lead with your uploaded logo. \n  - **Artistic Touch:** The logo now features a soft gold glow effect when the navbar is transparent, which gracefully fades out as you scroll to maintain a clean aesthetic.\n  - **Hover Dynamics:** The logo subtly scales up on hover to provide a premium, interactive feel.\n  - **Reliability:** I\'ve implemented a **smart fallback system**. If for any reason the image file (`logo.png`) isn\'t found in the project root, the navbar will automatically revert to the elegant typographic branding we created earlier, ensuring the site never looks broken.\n\n**Note:** To ensure the logo displays correctly, please make sure the image file is named **`logo.png`** and uploaded to your project\'s root directory.\n\nThe website now feels complete, professional, and perfectly aligned with the club\'s physical and digital identity!"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
