  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Revising Donation Language**\n\nI\'m currently updating the site\'s donation language to encourage participation more directly. I\'ve changed the \"Donate\" buttons to \"Join Us\" and \"Donate Now\" to \"Join the Fellowship.\" I\'m also re-working the `JoinUs` section\'s description to focus on membership benefits. Furthermore, I\'ll be implementing a more compatible Google Drive image URL.\n\n\n"
